tatus
how *.gitignore
*.py.bak


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# All NIfTI imaging, anywhere in the tree.
# ADNI imaging is not redistributable under the Data Use Agreement, and this
# covers raw, BIDS-converted, preprocessed and derivative volumes alike.
*.nii
*.nii.gz

# Exception: the Brainnetome atlas is NOT ADNI data. It is a publicly
# available parcellation (41 KB) that the code needs to rebuild the local
# attention mask and the ROI parcellation, so reproducibility depends on it.
!atlases/**/*.nii.gz
!atlases/**/*.nii
